    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Create a program to find the maximum number of handshakes among N number of students."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The formula to calculate the combination is"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "text",
      "content": "combination = (n * (n - 1)) / 2"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "where n = total number of students"
    },
